      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we add a profile for DTSHR as per https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/audio/vnd.dts.hd\n\nfield public static final String MIMETYPE_AUDIO_VND_DTSHD_PROFILE_HR \u003d \"audio/vnd.dts.hd;profile\u003ddtshr\";",
      "revId": "643d6f08e7bf47c2972b89f72ca38b9b645d9ac6",
